    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περῠσῐνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of last year, last year's</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of men and animals, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ π. ἄρχοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					855c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. φόρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.216.11
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δήμαρχος</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				22.1183.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἔφηβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					2.9
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ π. ἡγεμόνες</span>, of queen
			wasps. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				628a26
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π. κυήματα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				556a7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύβλιον π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					986
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ π. [καρπός]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					3.12.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. σπέρματα</span> Mnesith.  ap.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2.67.1
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ π. οἶνος</span> dub. in
				<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				7.47
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. ἔγληψις</span> Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				167.18
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>.</div>
